{"arrivo":"cs","origine":"ine-pro","origine_nome":"Proto-Indo-European","n":8,"parole":[{"parola":"liknavý","pos":"adj","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"no","significato":"dilatory","termine_origine":"*leykʷ-","catena":[{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*leykʷ-","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Inherited from Old Czech liknavý, ultimately from Proto-Indo-European *leykʷ-."},{"parola":"lákat","pos":"verb","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"no","significato":"to attract (to arouse interest)","termine_origine":"*leh₂-","catena":[{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*leh₂-","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Proto-Indo-European *leh₂- (“to be concealed”)."},{"parola":"odtažitý","pos":"adj","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"ereditato","incerta":"no","significato":"abstract (detached from reality)","termine_origine":"*tengʰ-","catena":[{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*tengʰ-","categoria":"ereditato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From odtáhnout (\"to drag away\"), itself derived from od- + táhnout (\"to drag\"). Ultimately from Proto-Indo-European *tengʰ- (“to pull”)."},{"parola":"povidla","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"sì","motivo_incerta":"Possibly","significato":"plum stew, powidl","termine_origine":"*peu-","catena":[{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*peu-","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":["cucina"],"via":"","testo":"Possibly from vít (“to wind, roll”), meaning “something produced by stirring, mixing of a boiled fruit juice”. An alternate etymology derives the word ultimately from Proto-Indo-European *peu- (“to cleanse, purify”), in the sense “purified concoction”."},{"parola":"strdí","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"no","significato":"honey","termine_origine":"*ser-","catena":[{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*ser-","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Related to Proto-Indo-European *ser-."},{"parola":"váhat","pos":"verb","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"no","significato":"to hesitate","termine_origine":"*weǵʰ-","catena":[{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*weǵʰ-","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Of a class of words related to \"weighing\" or \"considering,\" such as vážit (“to weigh”), vážný (“serious”), vyvážit (“to balance”), all ultimately from Proto-Indo-European *weǵʰ- (“to convey, transport”)."},{"parola":"vážný","pos":"adj","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"no","significato":"serious","termine_origine":"*weǵʰ-","catena":[{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*weǵʰ-","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Of a class of words related to \"weighing\" or \"considering,\" such as vážit (“to weigh”), all ultimately from Proto-Indo-European *weǵʰ- (“to convey, transport”)."},{"parola":"čára","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"non_precisato","incerta":"sì","motivo_incerta":"Possibly; Probably","significato":"line","termine_origine":"*(s)ker-","catena":[{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*(s)ker-","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":["scienza"],"via":"","testo":"Probably derived from čáry (“magic”), čarovat (“to conjure”), meaning a magical line, e.g. the delineation of a magic circle. Possibly connected also with Proto-Indo-European *(s)ker- (“to cut”). First attested in the 14th century."}]}